# Master of Death: "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this card is in your graveyard, you may pay 1 life. If you do,
# return it to your hand." Bot1's Master (surveil 2 on entering: one card kept on top, one into the graveyard) dies to Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt on turn 2. On turn 3's upkeep Bot1 declines to pay: it stays in the graveyard and Bot1 keeps its life
# (20). Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 is not Bot1's, so nothing triggers (the stack is empty). On turn 5's upkeep Bot1 pays: it
# is at 19 and the Master is back in its hand.

